rview with tucker  carlson of fox news and fox news's  opinion hosts were incredibly supportive  of kyle rittenhouse throughout his trial  now this interview took place over the  weekend and it will be part of a longer  documentary produced by tucker carlson  rittenhouse recounted why he says he  went to kenosha that night in august of  2020 and what happened leading up to his  shooting three men killing two of them  rittenhouse said even though he seems  calm he says he is freaking out inside  he also said he feels he's been defamed  by several people his mother singled out  then presidential candidate joe biden  i don't think i would be able to go out  and get a job  and not have to deal with harassment but  i'm at a place now to where  i have to have  people with me because people want to  kill me just because i defended myself  and they're  they're too ignorant to look at the  facts of what happened  now written house said that he wants to  continue studying nursing at arizona  state university and possibly study law  get that he said he also wants to live a  quiet normal life and will likely move  away from the midwest brian  thanks angenet lisa your reaction to  ringhouse's words after being  acquitted uh just incredible i mean i as  far as the interview went i think the  thing that stood out most to me was when  he made the assertion that listen i  support blm i am not racist there was  nothing found in his background to  attach him to any type of racially  motivated right-wing groups and when he  made the statement he didn't think the  trial was so much about him it was more  about the law and procedure of  self-defense being on trial very very uh  great distinction yeah i heard that as  well and agreed great distinction in  that terry acquitted in a court of law  but probably still on trial in the court  of public opinion what do you think is  next for rittenhouse  well it looks like with that recent  appearance on tucker caulston he is  definitely trying t